      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "There is no strategy, order intent, paper broker, exchange adapter or reconciliation service in this build, so orders, fills, fees, P&L, reconciliation age and mismatches are **not measured**. There is deliberately no placeholder panel for them. When each component is added, its metrics and panels are added in the same change (see docs/monitoring.md, reserved metrics)."
      }
